# When true (default), skip the embedding lifecycle while the chat/crisis model is
# loaded so chat responsiveness is not interrupted by Ollama model switching.
# Combined with ALPHARAVIS_EMBEDDING_UNLOAD_CHAT_MODEL=true, embedding work still
# runs during idle windows: the lifecycle unloads chat first, loads embedding,
# drains the queue, and leaves embedding loaded (RESTORE_CHAT=false).
